  "content": "Two rounds since September 1 had three or more three-putts. Both are Cole Bennett's, from October 21 at Springfield Country Club in a tournament.\n\n- One was a 74 with 37 putts and 3 three-putts.\n- The other was a 77 with 37 putts and 3 three-putts.\n\nCole also played a third round at Springfield that day, a 73 with 30 putts and no three-putts.\n\nCoverage is incomplete. I checked 26 rounds dated since September 1. In 14 of them no putts were recorded. These are the qualifier rounds on September 25 and 26 for Dylan Brooks, Owen Carter, Mason Rivers, Jackson Hale, Tyler Hayes, Ethan Park and Cole. Their three-putt field shows 0, but that is not a reliable count, so those rounds may have had three-putts I can't see. Three more of Cole's rounds are still in progress and have no stat line.",
